        "slc_c79da83a7b7b53e23dfc76112acf9eb256930a4142768efe158a33925bb41ac4"
      ],
      "text": "Most workflows are designed to run without any installed plugins, with few exceptions noted in the documentation, to lower the entry barrier and avoid ecosystem conflicts."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5c61a6fd13a40be72ba07295a2b3ed4f3eea01ddbea60aa00ebc300584fed725",
