        "slc_d0f85f05f53ef7a70f369fc38ac862a21a0a76a44ff6e1c5a2a32153097c00d9"
      ],
      "text": "Workflows are JSON files that can be loaded by dropping them onto the ComfyUI work area; generated images embed the full workflow and can also be dropped in to load the node structure."
    },
