      "text": "Sections cover basics of ComfyUI and Stable Diffusion, upscaling (hires fix), advanced text-to-image techniques (word weighting, embeddings, timestepping, gligen), image-to-image conditioning, in/out painting, and guided composition with ControlNets and T2I-Adapter."
    },
